{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>You will put my two sons to death.</b> He now cursed his two sons that they would die if he did not bring him back, like the curse of Rab to Samuel, as stated (Shabbat 108a): יְהֵא רַעֲוָא דְּלָא לוֹקְמוּ לֵיהּ בְּנֵי (may the Merciful One not require my sons to stand trial), and so it was."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:21.910016398Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}